{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"启示录","commonName":"启示录","title":"启示录","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"a3ce0eb35f9176382260d30d0f25dc139f193a7e6e65d0e12dc07a11030bd42e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":402},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["天使与小书卷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我看见另一位大能天使从天而降。他身披云霞，头顶彩虹，脸如太阳，双腿如火柱，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["手中拿着一卷打开了的小书卷，右脚踏在海中，左脚踏在地上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他大声呼喊，声如狮吼，呼喊之后有七声雷鸣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我正要将雷鸣的意思记录下来，就听见天上有声音说：“你要封住七声雷鸣所说的事，别写下来。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我刚才所见的那位脚踏海洋和陆地的天使向天举起右手，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["凭着活到永永远远、创造天地海洋和其中一切的上帝起誓说：“必不再耽延了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["等第七位天使吹响号角时，上帝奥秘的计划就实现了，正如上帝向祂的奴仆——众先知所宣告的。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["先前从天上对我说话的声音又吩咐我：“你去，从那位脚踏海洋陆地的天使手中把展开的小书卷拿来。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["于是，我走到天使面前，请他将小书卷给我。他对我说：“拿去吃了。你的腹中会感到苦涩，可是你口中会觉得甘甜如蜜。”",{"noteId":16}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我就从天使手中接过小书卷，吃了，口中果然甘甜如蜜，吃完后腹中觉得苦涩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["那天使又对我说：“你必要再对许多民族、国家、语言族群和君王说预言。”"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":16,"caller":"+","text":"以西结书3:3。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}